  "description": "COMING SOON Spacious Three-Bedroom Apartment | Wyckham Point, Dundrum\n\n**Coming soon to the rental market at Wyckham Point, Dundrum.**\n\nA spacious three-bedroom apartment featuring three double bedrooms will shortly become available within the highly sought-after Wyckham Point development.\n\nThe apartment is currently being prepared for occupation and is not yet available for immediate move-in. We are inviting prospective residents to register their interest now ahead of upcoming availability.\n\nOffering generous accommodation throughout, this apartment is ideal for those looking for additional space while enjoying all the benefits of living in one of Dundrum's most established residential developments.\n\n**Apartment Features**\n\n* Three spacious double bedrooms\n* Bright and generous open-plan living and dining area\n* Fully fitted modern kitchen\n* Excellent storage throughout\n* Contemporary bathrooms\n* Generously proportioned accommodation\n* Professionally managed development\n* Landscaped communal areas\n* Excellent location close to Dundrum Town Centre\n* Convenient access to the Luas and Dublin City Centre\n\nWyckham Point is ideally positioned in Dundrum, with Dundrum Town Centre and its extensive selection of shops, restaurants, cafés and leisure facilities within easy reach.\n\nThe development also benefits from excellent transport connections, including nearby Luas and bus services, along with convenient access to the M50 and Dublin City Centre.\n\n**Register Your Interest**\n\nThis three-bedroom apartment is coming soon and is currently being prepared for occupation.\n\nProspective residents are invited to submit an enquiry through the advert to register their interest and receive details of upcoming viewing opportunities and availability.",
